# home

Welcome to the VERUM browser. This page is an object: its address is the
hash of its content, so it can never change under you, and `why` tells you
who made it. Links go to exact content or nowhere.

## Start here

=> page:about what this browser is, and why it is not a web browser
=> page:sanskrit संस्कृतलिपि - programming in Sanskrit
=> tag:note your notes
=> tag:stats results produced by cells
=> tag:code programs

## Try

* follow 1   - go to the first link
* back       - return
* links      - list the links on this page
* publish pages/mine.patra   - add your own page

> नास्ति सत्यात् परो धर्मः - there is no law higher than truth.
